#ASSERT `the printed amount of` (`the amount the notice prints for my pension calculation` `ACA 1985` `a day in August 2025` `claimed in 2005` `a dependent partner` 1 2 `after the first 13 weeks and before the end of three years`) EQUALS JUST 2150
#ASSERT `the printed amount of` (`the amount the notice prints for my pension calculation` `ACA 1985` `a day in August 2026` `claimed in 2005` `a dependent partner` 1 2 `after the first 13 weeks and before the end of three years`) EQUALS JUST 3000
-- s 92B(3)(b)(iii): a claim made on 5 April 2010 itself (finding 7): both rows print $1,500.
#ASSERT `the printed amount of` (`the amount the notice prints for my pension calculation` `ACA 1985` `a day in August 2026` `claimed on 5 April 2010` `a dependent partner` 1 6 `after the first 13 weeks and before the end of three years`) EQUALS JUST 1500
-- s 92B(8)(b): five children, claim before 5 April 2010, "in equal shares": $715 before (715 / 5 = 143 each), $1,500 from (1,500 / 5 = 300 each).
#ASSERT `the printed amount of` (`the amount the notice prints for my pension calculation` `ACA 1985` `a day in August 2025` `claimed in 2005` `a dependent child` 1 5 `after the first 13 weeks and before the end of three years`) EQUALS JUST 715
#ASSERT `the equal share of` (`the amount the notice prints for my pension calculation` `ACA 1985` `a day in August 2025` `claimed in 2005` `a dependent child` 1 5 `after the first 13 weeks and before the end of three years`) EQUALS JUST 143
#ASSERT `the equal share of` (`the amount the notice prints for my pension calculation` `ACA 1985` `a day in August 2026` `claimed in 2005` `a dependent child` 1 5 `after the first 13 weeks and before the end of three years`) EQUALS JUST 300
-- On or after 5 April 2010: $976 before, $1,500 from.
#ASSERT `the printed amount of` (`the amount the notice prints for my pension calculation` `ACA 1985` `a day in August 2025` `claimed in 2020` `a dependent child` 1 5 `after the first 13 weeks and before the end of three years`) EQUALS JUST 976
-- s 92B(7)(b): a child, three children, claim on or after 5 April 2010: $3,000.
#ASSERT `the provision of` (`the amount the notice prints for my pension calculation` `ACA 1985` `a day in August 2026` `claimed in 2020` `a dependent child` 1 3 `after the first 13 weeks and before the end of three years`) EQUALS JUST "s 92B(7)(b), for a claim made on or after 5 April 2010"

§ `weekly pensions after the maximum`

-- A partner, first 13 weeks, 2013 Act: formula 3,200 -> 3,000; formula 2,500 -> 2,500.
#ASSERT `my weekly pension after the maximum` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` `claimed in 2020` `a dependent partner` 1 FALSE 0 `during the first 13 weeks` 3200 EQUALS `answered` 3000
#ASSERT `my weekly pension after the maximum` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` `claimed in 2020` `a dependent partner` 1 FALSE 0 `during the first 13 weeks` 2500 EQUALS `answered` 2500
-- Two partners: each capped at 1,500; formula 1,800 -> 1,500.
#ASSERT `my weekly pension after the maximum` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` `claimed in 2020` `a dependent partner` 2 FALSE 0 `during the first 13 weeks` 1800 EQUALS `answered` 1500
-- 1985 Act, claim in 2005, partner after 13 weeks: s 92B(3)(b)(i) $2,200; formula 2,400 -> 2,200.
#ASSERT `my weekly pension after the maximum` `ACA 1985` `a day in August 2026` `claimed in 2005` `a dependent partner` 1 FALSE 0 `after the first 13 weeks and before the end of three years` 2400 EQUALS `answered` 2200
-- A child with a surviving partner has no maximum row.
#ASSERT `my weekly pension after the maximum` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` `claimed in 2020` `a dependent child` 1 FALSE 2 `after the first 13 weeks and before the end of three years` 900 EQUALS `not covered` `the notice prints only an amount for the Act's weekly pension calculation here, not a maximum`

§ `medical and like services for the family (2013 Act lines 675-689; 1985 Act lines 287-294)`

#ASSERT `the most our family can be paid for counselling and support` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` EQUALS `answered` 10310
#ASSERT `the most our family can be paid for counselling and support` `ACA 1985` `a day in August 2025` EQUALS `answered` 10000
-- s 224(1)(e), line 684: burial 150 km away: $6,540 (before $6,340); s 99(1)(d), line 290: $6,540.
#ASSERT `the most I can be paid to attend the burial or cremation` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` 150 EQUALS `answered` 6540
#ASSERT `the most I can be paid to attend the burial or cremation` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2025` 150 EQUALS `answered` 6340
#ASSERT `the most I can be paid to attend the burial or cremation` `ACA 1985` `a day in August 2026` 150 EQUALS `answered` 6540
-- 100 km is not "more than 100km"; 80 km neither.
#ASSERT `the most I can be paid to attend the burial or cremation` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` 100 EQUALS `not covered` `the notice prints this travel and accommodation maximum only where the distance is more than 100 km`
#ASSERT `the most I can be paid to attend the burial or cremation` `ACA 1985` `a day in August 2026` 80 EQUALS `not covered` `the notice prints this travel and accommodation maximum only where the distance is more than 100 km`
#ASSERT `the most I can be paid to attend the burial or cremation` `ACA 1985` `the first day of July 2027` 80 EQUALS `outside the two years`
-- s 224(1)(d), line 678: $25,620; none under the 1985 Act.
#ASSERT `the most I can be paid to be with the worker in hospital` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` TRUE 250 EQUALS `answered` 25620
#ASSERT `the most I can be paid to be with the worker in hospital` `ACA 1985` `a day in August 2026` TRUE 250 EQUALS `no row under that Act`

