§ `mirror cases: the same facts asked from the worker's seat and the family's seat`

-- Family counselling (s 224(1)(b), s 99(1)(b)): $10,310 both ways.
#ASSERT `the most my family can be paid for counselling and support` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` EQUALS `answered` 10310
#ASSERT `the most my family can be paid for counselling and support` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` EQUALS `the most our family can be paid for counselling and support` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026`
-- Hospital travel (s 224(1)(d)): a severely injured worker taken straight to hospital, the family 250 km away: $25,620 both ways.
#ASSERT `the most my family can be paid to be with me in hospital` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` TRUE 250 EQUALS `answered` 25620
#ASSERT `the most my family can be paid to be with me in hospital` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` TRUE 250 EQUALS `the most I can be paid to be with the worker in hospital` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` TRUE 250
-- The same, 80 km away: not covered both ways, for the same reason.
#ASSERT `the most my family can be paid to be with me in hospital` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` TRUE 80 EQUALS `the most I can be paid to be with the worker in hospital` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` TRUE 80
#ASSERT `the most I can be paid to be with the worker in hospital` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` TRUE 80 EQUALS `not covered` `the notice prints this travel and accommodation maximum only where the distance is more than 100 km`
-- Not severely injured: not covered both ways.
#ASSERT `the most my family can be paid to be with me in hospital` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` FALSE 250 EQUALS `the most I can be paid to be with the worker in hospital` `WIRC 2013` `a day in August 2026` FALSE 250
